<title>POLAND: JUTRZENKA MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>JUTRZENKA MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.60 vs   0.86</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.33 vs   1.33</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.50 vs   1.46</p>
<p> Sales		   12.55 vs  10.39</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.33 vs   3.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.28 vs   4.99</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.69 vs   5.33</p>
<p> Sales		   36.79 vs  30.08</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectionery is</p>
<p>Przedsiebiorstwo Cukiernicze Jutrzenka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
